File: mips/filter_msa_intrinsics.c
Line: 435
Function: png_read_filter_row_up_msa
Bug type: out-of-bounds-read
CWE: CWE-125
Explanation: For a remaining length of 1–15 bytes, LD_UB reads a full 16-byte vector from row and prev_row, overreading the tail.

